          "hak": "禾鷝仔，啜嘩嘩，有啜話別人，冇啜話自家。",
          "rom": "vo2 bit5 zai3, zoi4 | va1 va1, yiu1 | zoi4 | va4 | piet6 ngin2, mau2 | zoi4 | va4 | ci2 ga1."
        }
      ],
      "id": "nursery-1"
